    <title>systemd简单学习</title>
    <link href="/2025/02/28/systemd%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/"/>
    <url>/2025/02/28/systemd%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>systemd是作为现代系统和服务管理器替代SystemV init，同时也兼容SystemV init。他是一套工具兼顾了系统启动时，比如磁盘挂载，网络配置，ntp时间同步等。系统启动时，会启动一个<code>systemd</code>的一号进程，用于管理用户态的进程和服务。</p><h1 id="一些命令"><a href="#一些命令" class="headerlink" title="一些命令"></a>一些命令</h1><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Systemd</th><th>意义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>service nginx start</td><td>systemctl start nginx</td><td>启动</td></tr><tr><td>service nginx restart</td><td>systemctl restart nginx</td><td>重启</td></tr><tr><td>service nginx stop</td><td>systemctl stop nginx</td><td>暂停</td></tr><tr><td>chkconfig –list</td><td>systemctl list-unit-files –all –state enabled</td><td>查看自启的服务</td></tr><tr><td>chkconfig nginx on</td><td>systemctl enable nginx</td><td>开启自启动</td></tr><tr><td>chkconfig nginx off</td><td>systemctl disable nginx</td><td>关闭自启动</td></tr><tr><td>service nginx reload</td><td>systemctl reload nginx</td><td>重载配置文件</td></tr><tr><td>service nginx status</td><td>systemctl status nginx<br>systemctl is-active nginx<br>systemctl is-failed nginx<br>systemctl is-enabled nginx</td><td>查看服务状态</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>systemctl list-unit-files –all –type service</td><td>查看存在的服务</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>systemctl –failed</td><td>查看失败的服务</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>systemctl daemon-reload</td><td>重载systemd服务</td></tr></tbody></table><h1 id="创建服务"><a href="#创建服务" class="headerlink" title="创建服务"></a>创建服务</h1><p>Systemd unit位置主要存在于两个地方</p><h2 id="usr-lib-systemd-system"><a href="#usr-lib-systemd-system" class="headerlink" title="&#x2F;usr&#x2F;lib&#x2F;systemd&#x2F;system"></a>&#x2F;usr&#x2F;lib&#x2F;systemd&#x2F;system</h2><p>存放所有systemd unit,包括<code>service</code>和其他类型</p><h2 id="etc-systemd-system"><a href="#etc-systemd-system" class="headerlink" title="&#x2F;etc&#x2F;systemd&#x2F;system"></a>&#x2F;etc&#x2F;systemd&#x2F;system</h2><p>存放自启动文件</p><h2 id="单元类型"><a href="#单元类型" class="headerlink" title="单元类型"></a>单元类型</h2><p><a href="https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_enterprise_linux/7/html/system_administrators_guide/chap-Managing_Services_with_systemd#sect-Managing_Services_with_systemd-Introduction">https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_enterprise_linux/7/html/system_administrators_guide/chap-Managing_Services_with_systemd#sect-Managing_Services_with_systemd-Introduction</a></p><table><thead><tr><th>type</th><th>suffix</th><th>descrition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>service</td><td>.service</td><td>一个服务</td></tr><tr><td>target service</td><td>.target</td><td>一组服务</td></tr><tr><td>automount</td><td>.automount</td><td>在需要访问时挂载</td></tr><tr><td>mount</td><td>.mount</td><td>开机自动挂载</td></tr><tr><td>socket</td><td>.socket</td><td>套接字</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="编写服务"><a href="#编写服务" class="headerlink" title="编写服务"></a>编写服务</h2><p>因为我需要一个Tomcat的自启动任务,所以是<code>service</code>类型</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-section">[Unit]</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">Description</span>=Tomcat service<br><span class="hljs-attr">After</span>=network.target<br><br><span class="hljs-section">[Service]</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">Type</span>=forking<br><span class="hljs-attr">Environment</span>=JAVA_HOME=/opt/Java/jdk1.<span class="hljs-number">8.0</span>_202<br><span class="hljs-attr">ExecStartPre</span>=/usr/bin/rm -f /run/tomcatCustom.pid<br><span class="hljs-attr">ExecStart</span>=/opt/Java/apache-tomcat-<span class="hljs-number">9.0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">102</span>/bin/catalina.sh start<br><span class="hljs-attr">ExecReload</span>=/bin/kill -s HUP <span class="hljs-variable">$MAINPID</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">ExecStop</span>=/bin/kill -<span class="hljs-number">15</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$MAINPID</span> <br><span class="hljs-attr">KillSignal</span>=SIGQUIT<br><span class="hljs-attr">TimeoutStopSec</span>=<span class="hljs-number">5</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">KillMode</span>=mixed<br><span class="hljs-attr">PrivateTmp</span>=<span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br><br><span class="hljs-section">[Install]</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">WantedBy</span>=multi-user.target<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>Type</code> <code>forking</code> 类型适用于 <code>ExecStart</code>执行后运行于后台的程序 例如: <code>Nginx</code> <code>Tomcat</code></p><p><code>Type</code> <code>Simple</code> 类型适用于 <code>ExecStart</code>执行后运行于前台的程序 直接在当前终端运行 例如: <code>promethus</code> </p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">[root@TestHost ~]# systemctl daemon-reload <br>[root@TestHost ~]# systemctl start tomcatCustom.service <br>[root@TestHost ~]# systemctl status tomcatCustom.service <br>● tomcatCustom.service - Tomcat service<br>     Loaded: loaded (/usr/lib/systemd/system/tomcatCustom.service; disabled; preset: disabled)<br>     Active: active (running) since Fri 2025-03-14 16:04:17 CST; 3s ago<br>    Process: 3319 ExecStartPre=/usr/bin/rm -f /run/tomcatCustom.pid (code=exited, status=0/SUCCESS)<br>    Process: 3322 ExecStart=/opt/Java/apache-tomcat-9.0.102/bin/catalina.sh start (code=exited, status=0/SUCCESS)<br>   Main PID: 3328 (java)<br>      Tasks: 13 (<span class="hljs-built_in">limit</span>: 21570)<br>     Memory: 107.9M ()<br>     CGroup: /system.slice/tomcatCustom.service<br>             └─3328 /opt/Java/jdk1.8.0_202/bin/java -Djava.util.logging.config.file=/opt/Java/apache-tomcat-9.0.102/conf/loggin&gt;<br><br>3月 14 16:04:17 TestHost systemd[1]: Starting Tomcat service...<br>3月 14 16:04:17 TestHost catalina.sh[3322]: Tomcat started.<br>3月 14 16:04:17 TestHost systemd[1]: Started Tomcat service.<br>[root@TestHost ~]# netstat -tunlp | grep 8080<br>tcp6       0      0 :::8080                 :::*                    LISTEN      3328/java <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
